#X obj 666 11 fx.looper~;
#X obj 230 78 cnv 1 535 166 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -237178 -1 0;
#X text 240 83 A single-track audio looper. The object records the
incoming signal into an internal buffer (or into an array specified
with the @array property) and then plays it back in a loop. The loop
can be overdubbed \, paused \, stopped and cleared. The maximum loop
length is set with the CAPACITY argument or the @capacity property.
Various fade-in and fade-out times control smooth transitions between
the internal states: record \, play \, overdub and stop.;
